# FIRST STEP — IDENTIFY THE TARGET ROLE

Before rewriting, determine:

- Exact target title.
- Company, if known.
- Job description.
- Country/market.
- Remote/hybrid/on-site requirements.
- Required technologies.
- Required programming languages.
- Required years of experience.
- Expected seniority.
