# LEADERSHIP WITHOUT PEOPLE MANAGEMENT

Do not equate leadership with management.

Technical leadership can include:

- Framework ownership.
- Standards.
- Architecture.
- Code reviews.
- Mentoring.
- Technical decisions.
- Cross-team initiatives.
- Release ownership.

If the candidate did not manage people, do not imply that they did.

