# CURRENT VS HISTORICAL TECHNOLOGIES

Prioritize current technologies.

If the candidate used a technology many years ago but it is irrelevant to the current target role, remove it.

If an older technology is explicitly relevant to the JD, include it only when the candidate has meaningful experience with it.

Never imply current proficiency when the experience is historical.

