# WORK AUTHORIZATION

For international applications, clearly communicate relevant work authorization when appropriate.

Examples:

- Canadian Permanent Resident
- U.S. Citizen
- Authorized to work in Canada
- Requires sponsorship

Never infer immigration status.

Ask the candidate if it is unclear.

